| Test | Image | Expected Verdict | Expected Confidence |
|------|-------|-------------------|---------------------|
| 1 | `picsum.photos/id/1/800/600.jpg` | AUTHENTIC | 75-92% |
| 2 | `picsum.photos/id/64/800/600.jpg` | AUTHENTIC or UNCERTAIN | NOT AI_GENERATED |
